        "original_id": "43b3d4ed-ef89-5442-8c33-34b2f0d05bad",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mike Gibbons, Tommy Gibbons, Stanley Ketchel\n- Places: St. Paul, Minnesota, Conway, Missouri\n- Roles: American boxer, heavyweight, middleweight champion\n\nFacts:\n- Mike Gibbons was born on July 20, 1887, in St. Paul, Minnesota.\n- Mike Gibbons was an American boxer whose career lasted from 1908 to 1922.\n- In 1909, after Stanley Ketchel was murdered, Mike Gibbons claimed Middleweight Champion of the World status.\n- Tommy Gibbons was Mike Gibbons's brother and was a heavyweight boxer.\n- Stanley Ketchel was murdered at a ranch in Conway, Missouri, at the age of 24.\n- Mike Gibbons died on August 31, 1956.",
